---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="VTC HUB — SaaS Architecture Case Study"
  description="Architecture and technical details of VTC HUB, a B2B SaaS for drivers."
>
  <header class="header" role="banner">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main Navigation">
      <a href="/#work" class="logo" aria-label="Back to home">&larr; Back</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="case-study-main">
    <article class="case-study-content">
      <header class="cs-header">
        <div class="badge">Monorepo SaaS</div>
        <h1>VTC HUB</h1>
        <p class="cs-lead">A multi-tenant, double-sided SaaS platform providing booking, dispatch, and immutable accounting for professional driver fleets.</p>
        
        <div class="cs-meta">
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="meta-label">Role</span>
            <span class="meta-value">Lead Architect & Fullstack</span>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="meta-label">Stack</span>
            <span class="meta-value">Astro 5, React 19, Supabase, Cloudflare Pages</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="cs-body">
        <h2>System Architecture</h2>
        <p>VTC HUB is not a single application, but an ecosystem of three distinct frontends connected to a centralized Supabase backend, deployed from a single Turborepo-managed monorepo.</p>
        
        <ul class="cs-list">
          <li><strong>Driver App (Astro/React):</strong> Mobile-first PWA for drivers to manage trips, track earnings, and generate certified PDF invoices.</li>
          <li><strong>Backoffice (Astro/React):</strong> Dispatch dashboard for fleet managers, featuring real-time availability and dynamic pricing algorithms.</li>
          <li><strong>Superadmin:</strong> Internal tool for managing tenant subscriptions and platform health.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Technical Highlights</h2>
        <p>The core challenge was <strong>multi-tenant data isolation</strong> without sacrificing performance. I utilized PostgreSQL's Row Level Security (RLS) tightly coupled with Supabase Auth to ensure that a driver in Tenant A cannot mathematically access dispatch data from Tenant B.</p>
        
        <p>For deployment, the monorepo pushes to Cloudflare Pages. A custom edge routing layer handles custom domains (Host Header routing), allowing fleet managers to run the SaaS under their own domain names.</p>
        
        <div class="cs-code-block">
          <div class="code-header">
            <span class="dot-red"></span><span class="dot-yellow"></span><span class="dot-green"></span>
            <span class="code-title">edge-router.ts</span>
          </div>
          <div class="code-body">
            <span class="kw">export default</span> {'{'}
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="kw">async</span> <span class="fn">fetch</span>(request, env) {'{'}
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="kw">const</span> url = <span class="kw">new</span> URL(request.url);
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="kw">const</span> tenant = <span class="kw">await</span> env.TENANTS.get(url.hostname);
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="kw">if</span> (!tenant) <span class="kw">return new</span> Response(<span class="str">"Not Found"</span>, {'{'} status: <span class="num">404</span> {'}'});
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="kw">return</span> <span class="fn">rewriteRequest</span>(request, tenant);
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;{'}'}
            <br>{'}'}
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 id="demo">Live Environments & Access</h2>
        <p>The platform is actively deployed across multiple Cloudflare environments. Below are the access points for the staging environments.</p>

        <div class="demo-grid">
          <div class="demo-card">
            <h3>Driver App</h3>
            <p>Mobile-first interface for drivers on the road.</p>
            <div class="demo-creds">
              <span class="cred-label">URL:</span> <a href="https://vtc-drivers-front-dev.pages.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">vtc-drivers-front-dev.pages.dev</a><br>
              <span class="cred-label">User:</span> <code>driver@demo.com</code><br>
              <span class="cred-label">Pass:</span> <code>demo1234</code>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="demo-card">
            <h3>Backoffice</h3>
            <p>Dispatch and accounting dashboard for fleet managers.</p>
            <div class="demo-creds">
              <span class="cred-label">URL:</span> <a href="https://vtc-backoffice-dev.pages.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">vtc-backoffice-dev.pages.dev</a><br>
              <span class="cred-label">User:</span> <code>admin@demo.com</code><br>
              <span class="cred-label">Pass:</span> <code>demo1234</code>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.8);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .logo {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .logo:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .case-study-main {
    padding: 8rem 1.25rem 5rem;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .case-study-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .case-study-content {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .cs-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .cs-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .cs-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .meta-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .cs-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .cs-body p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .cs-list {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .cs-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .cs-list strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .cs-code-block {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
  .code-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .code-title {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  .dot-red { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF5F57; }
  .dot-yellow { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFBD2E; }
  .dot-green { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #28C840; }
  .code-body {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .kw { color: #cba6f7; }
  .fn { color: #89b4fa; }
  .str { color: #a6e3a1; }
  .num { color: #fab387; }

  .demo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .demo-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  .demo-card {
    background: var(--bg-base);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .demo-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .demo-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .demo-creds {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .cred-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: inline-block;
    width: 45px;
  }
  .demo-creds a {
    color: var(--accent-light);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .demo-creds a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .demo-creds code {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #a6e3a1;
  }
</style>
